                     {
                        "content" : [
                           {
                              "text" : "Maybe hypbrid of WaitableEvent and ConditionVarHelper – which adds to CondtionVarHelper a function<> object that is quivilent to the ‘fTriggerd’ flag with the WaitableEvent. Then you just construct this object (passing in right tester) and you can ‘wait’ reliably. Not that different from regular condition_var  - except you specify the condition tester ONCE in one place – not at every wait location. Maybe call ConditionVariableEvent?",
