               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "Windows AutoReset waitable evnet – MAY – guarantee to wakeup one thread. I’m not sure mine does. But make clear, autoreset is for when only about one thread to twakeup, and use manual reset if you want to wake them all up.",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "              See ",
